v 3
d 'DIAGTAB': Publication-ready diagnostic test accuracy and cutoff analysis
d
d diagtab computes diagnostic accuracy measures, confidence intervals, ROC AUC,
d and cutoff analyses, with console, Excel, CSV, Markdown, and frame output.
